            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>This month, we focus on current research in obstetric antecedents of chronic disease. Dr Malone discusses four recent publications, and each is concluded with a &quot;bottom line&quot; that is the take-home message. The complete reference for each can be found in on this page along with direct links to the abstracts.</AbstractText>
